    "body": "Merged main to resolve conflicts. The PR is stacked on #576, which is on #566, so I merged #576's refreshed branch first. That brings #566 and main with it. Then I merged upstream/main, which was already up to date.\n\n- **Resolution:** `ui/src/state.rs` was the only conflict: this PR's `use locate_ui::with_warning` beside main's fixture-library module. I kept both.\n- **Targeted gate:**\n  - app lib 107, `move_interpenetration` 8, `move_model_stock` 4, `fixture_locate` 11, `fixture_locate_stock` 3, `commands_undo` 32, `mcp_setup` 5, `fixtures` 14, ui lib 430: all green.\n  - clippy `-D warnings` on app lib + `move_interpenetration`, and ui lib+tests: clean.\n\nReady for a re-check (/resolve-conflicts check). Merge order: #566, then #576, then this one.",
